sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as n8n scheduler
  participant B as Brain
  participant D as Database
  participant P as Your phone

  loop every minute
    S->>B: "tick"
    B->>B: what's due now? reminders, morning brief,<br/>inbox triage, follow-ups, price drops, weekly review
    B->>D: save messages in the outbox
    B-->>S: messages to send
    S->>P: send on Telegram / WhatsApp
    S->>B: report sent / failed
    B->>D: mark each message
  end
  Note over S,D: Stored first, confirmed after sending →<br/>no message is lost or sent twice
